  "body": "Sea Views on Every Level\r\n\r\nImagine waking up to stunning sea views every morning, enjoying your coffee overlooking beautiful Long Bay, and ending each day with spectacular coastal sunsets from the comfort of your own home.\r\n\r\nPositioned on an elevated site in one of Long Bay's most desirable streets, this exceptional Home & Land Package offers the rare opportunity to build a luxury home where both the ground floor and upper level capture beautiful sea views, an increasingly rare feature in today's market.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed for modern family living, the proposed home features generous open-plan living spaces, seamless indoor-outdoor flow, and multiple living areas across two levels. High-quality finishes, elegant contemporary architecture, and the flexibility to personalise selected colours and finishes create a home that truly reflects your lifestyle.\r\nWhether you're looking for a sophisticated family residence or your forever coastal retreat, this is your opportunity to create a home that combines beautiful sea views, timeless design and one of Auckland's most desirable coastal locations. \r\n\r\nHome Highlights: \r\n• Premium elevated freehold site \r\n• Sea views from both ground and upper levels \r\n• Architecturally designed Home & Land Package \r\n• 5 spacious bedrooms\r\n• 4.5 luxury bathrooms\r\n• Multiple living areas across two levels\r\n• Designer open-plan kitchen\r\n• Seamless indoor-outdoor entertaining\r\n• Double internal-access garage\r\n• High-quality finishes throughout\r\n• Personalise selected finishes and colours\r\n• Designed for multi-generational living\r\n• 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\n\r\nCustomisation options are subject to developer approval and the stage of construction.\r\n\r\nLive the Long Bay Lifestyle.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the very best of coastal living, just minutes from your doorstep:\r\n• Long Bay Beach\r\n• Long Bay Regional Park\r\n• Scenic coastal walking tracks\r\n• Long Bay Village\r\n• New World Supermarket\r\n• Cafés & Restaurants\r\n• Medical Centre\r\n• Pharmacy\r\n• Gym\r\n• Dentist\r\n• Long Bay Primary School\r\n• Long Bay College\r\n\r\nA community where natural beauty, excellent schools and everyday convenience come together. \r\n\r\nBuild with Confidence\r\n\r\nDesigned with quality, comfort and timeless style in mind, this premium Home & Land Package includes quality specifications and is backed by a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee, giving you confidence from design through to\r\ncompletion.\r\n\r\nCreate the Coastal Lifestyle You've Always Dreamed of!\r\n\r\nOpportunities to secure an elevated site with sea views on both levels in Long Bay are becoming increasingly rare.\r\nMore than just a Home & Land Package, it's your opportunity to create the coastal lifestyle you've always dreamed of.\r\nContact us today to learn more. Conjunctional Agents Welcome\r\nWe welcome conjunctional agents and look forward to working together to help buyers discover this exceptional home.",
